  "We have received your details. One of our support staff will call you shortly to confirm the appointment.": { so: "Waan helnay xogtaada. Mid ka mid ah shaqaalahayaga ayaa dhawaan ku soo wici doona si loo xaqiijiyo ballanta.", ar: "لقد استلمنا بياناتك. سيتصل بك أحد موظفي الدعم قريباً لتأكيد الموعد." },
